        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T14:19:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One the WebGPU API side we won\u0027t make a difference between a type-full array and a type-less one. This means that it will be allowed to have a BindGroup with non-existent entries or one with a different type, and we need to allow that.\n\nIn a way the type-full version is a way to get us testing end2end with less Tint changes required, but still the full mechanisms for dynamic types + array OOB.",
      "parentUuid": "9dbf2a4c_c6e4258c",
      "revId": "30cc213d6672c535801eedd53011c38688d5c143",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "defbca4e_d78a1d6d",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/core/ir/transform/runtime_binding_array.h",
