      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T17:19:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chatting with James, since it seems like type-full and type-less are the same implementation, there isn\u0027t less work to do type-full, so we\u0027re thinking of just dropping type-full and going full type-less (since we need `getBinding` and `hasBinding` for type-full).\n\nThinking through full type-less we actually think it\u0027s easier to rename the type so we have `binding_array\u003cT, size\u003e` and  `resource_buffer` which is type-less (parsing a new type is easier then dealing with maybe templated).",
      "parentUuid": "aea47ffc_5608a099",
